  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-17T23:43:48.049Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be very appreciated to be able to have a separate set of defaults for mobile. \n\nFor example, my home world on desktop is 90 MB but I would prefer to use the default home or a home box on mobile to save on data. \n\nI'd also like to be able to set a default avatar for mobile instead of it trying to use my latest used on desktop (this might already be the case)",
